<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alco Standard lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alco Standard lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securites said analyst Anton Brenner downgraded Alco Standard Corp to hold from buy based on a forecast of slower earnings growth for the company.</p>
<p>-- Earnings growth beyond fiscal 1997, which had been estimated at 40-to-45 percent per year, is now forecast at 30-to-35 percent a year, the analyst said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 40-5/8.</p>
</text>
